{"recipes":[{"_id":"dish-beef-bacon-scallops","titleEn":"Beef Bacon Wrapped Scallops","titleEs":"Vieiras envueltas en tocino de res","recipeType":"DISH","category":"To Plate","active":true,"sortOrder":4,"methodEn":"Use a sauté pan, preheat to medium heat. Add blend oil. Add scallops to the pan, presentation side down first. Flip over scallops, 1 minute each side. What you’re looking for: bacon tightens around scallop; fat renders out and edges begin to crisp. Add butter, garlic and thyme. Tilt pan and spoon butter over scallops continuously for 30 seconds. Remove from the stove and place them inside the oven for 1 minute. Take out of the oven and let them rest for 1 minute before plating.","methodEs":"Use una sartén para saltear y precaliéntela a fuego medio. Agregue el aceite mezclado. Coloque las vieiras en la sartén con el lado de presentación hacia abajo primero. Voltéelas y cocine 1 minuto por cada lado. Lo que debe observar: el tocino se ajusta alrededor de la vieira, la grasa se derrite y los bordes comienzan a dorarse y ponerse crujientes. Agregue mantequilla, ajo y tomillo. Incline la sartén y bañe continuamente las vieiras con la mantequilla durante 30 segundos. Retire del fuego y colóquelas en el horno durante 1 minuto. Sáquelas del horno y déjelas reposar 1 minuto antes de emplatar."},{"_id":"prep-bacon-wrapped-scallops","titleEn":"Bacon Wrapped Scallops","titleEs":"Vieiras envueltas en tocino de res","recipeType":"SUBRECIPE","category":"Preparation","active":true,"sortOrder":5,"methodEn":"Remove the side muscle from each scallop. Place scallops on a paper towel-lined tray. Cover lightly and refrigerate uncovered for at least 1 hour.\n\nLay bacon slices flat on a parchment-lined tray. Cook at 165°C / 325°F for 6–10 minutes. Pull when fat has started to render, color is light golden, and it is still flexible (NOT crispy). Transfer to a cooling rack.\n\nLightly season scallops with salt (all sides). Wrap 1 slice of beef bacon around each scallop. Secure with a toothpick.","methodEs":"Retire el músculo lateral de cada vieira. Coloque las vieiras en una bandeja forrada con papel toalla. Cubra ligeramente y refrigere destapadas durante al menos 1 hora.\n\nColoque las rebanadas de tocino planas sobre una bandeja forrada con papel pergamino. Cocine a 165°C / 325°F durante 6–10 minutos. Retire cuando la grasa haya comenzado a derretirse, el color sea dorado claro y el tocino todavía esté flexible (NO crujiente). Transfiera a una rejilla para enfriar.\n\nSazone ligeramente las vieiras con sal por todos los lados. Envuelva cada vieira con 1 rebanada de tocino de res. Asegure con un palillo."},{"_id":"prep-yuzu-achiote","titleEn":"Yuzu Achiote Marinade","titleEs":"Marinada de yuzu y achiote","recipeType":"SUBRECIPE","category":"Preparation","yieldQty":1,"yieldUnitEn":"qt","yieldUnitEs":"qt","active":true,"sortOrder":6,"methodEn":"Soak chiles in hot water for 1–2 hours to rehydrate. Blend chiles together with cumin, honey, oil, coriander, achiote and yuzu until smooth. Strain well.","methodEs":"Remoje los chiles en agua caliente durante 1–2 horas para rehidratarlos. Licúe los chiles junto con el comino, la miel, el aceite, el cilantro, el achiote y el yuzu hasta obtener una mezcla lisa. Cuele bien."},{"_id":"prep-cream-of-corn","titleEn":"Cream of Corn","titleEs":"Crema de maíz","recipeType":"SUBRECIPE","category":"Preparation","active":true,"sortOrder":7,"methodEn":"Roast corn at 425°F until lightly caramelized before adding to the pot. In a large skillet over medium heat, melt the butter. Add corn, onions, leeks, thyme, bay leaves, corn stock, and salt, and simmer for 30 minutes, or until liquid reduces by half. Season with salt and pepper. Remove it from heat and place it in a hotel pan to cool down in the refrigerator. Label and date it.","methodEs":"Ase el maíz a 425°F hasta que esté ligeramente caramelizado antes de agregarlo a la olla. En una sartén grande a fuego medio, derrita la mantequilla. Agregue el maíz, la cebolla, los puerros, el tomillo, las hojas de laurel, el fondo de maíz y la sal, y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos o hasta que el líquido se reduzca a la mitad. Sazone con sal y pimienta. Retire del fuego y coloque en una bandeja hotel para enfriar en el refrigerador. Etiquete y feche."}],"sections":[{"_id":"scallops-plate","recipeId":"dish-beef-bacon-scallops","titleEn":"To Plate","titleEs":"Para emplatar","sortOrder":1},{"_id":"scallops-prep-ing","recipeId":"prep-bacon-wrapped-scallops","titleEn":"Ingredients","titleEs":"Ingredientes","sortOrder":1},{"_id":"yuzu-achiote-ing","recipeId":"prep-yuzu-achiote","titleEn":"Ingredients","titleEs":"Ingredientes","sortOrder":1},{"_id":"cream-corn-ing","recipeId":"prep-cream-of-corn","titleEn":"Ingredients","titleEs":"Ingredientes","sortOrder":1}],"components":[{"_id":"sc-d1","sectionId":"scallops-plate","componentType":"SUBRECIPE","quantity":3,"unitEn":"ea","unitEs":"u","displayEn":"Beef bacon wrapped scallops","displayEs":"Vieiras envueltas en tocino de res","targetRecipeId":"prep-bacon-wrapped-scallops","targetIngredientId":"","targetPreparationId":"","sortOrder":1,"noteEn":"","noteEs":""},{"_id":"sc-d2","sectionId":"scallops-plate","componentType":"INGREDIENT","quantity":10,"unitEn":"g","unitEs":"g","displayEn":"Blend oil","displayEs":"Aceite mezclado","targetRecipeId":"","targetIngredientId":"blend-oil","targetPreparationId":"","sortOrder":2,"noteEn":"","noteEs":""},{"_id":"sc-d3","sectionId":"scallops-plate","componentType":"INGREDIENT","quantity":1,"unitEn":"tbsp","unitEs":"tbsp","displayEn":"Unsalted butter","displayEs":"Mantequilla sin sal","targetRecipeId":"","targetIngredientId":"unsalted-butter","targetPreparationId":"","sortOrder":3,"noteEn":"","noteEs":""},{"_id":"sc-d4","sectionId":"scallops-plate","componentType":"PREPARATION","quantity":1,"unitEn":"ea","unitEs":"u","displayEn":"Garlic clove (lightly crushed)","displayEs":"Diente de ajo (ligeramente machacado)","targetRecipeId":"","targetIngredientId":"ga